       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today’s Wild Summer Update adds a collection of fresh new outfits and emotes. Alongside the cosmetic updates, the new season implements several quality-of-life improvements, including improved game balancing, updated matchmaking and rank progression.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
